1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Phobos Phantoms OG 7.66 presents Marswalk:
planning the first human walk on Mars.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Real NASA terrain of Jezero Crater, with an AI hazard map
checked on held-out ground.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Five science stops, 4.4 km, and always a way back:
at least 136 minutes to spare.

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Put it on your desk in a Quest 3,
then step inside and walk it.

5
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:22,500
Walk beside Perseverance's real path,
sols 405 to 717.

6
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:27,000
Press "Get me home": the planner routes you back
around steep and hazardous ground.

7
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:29,500
Next: rehearse real EVAs before astronauts land.
